== ui_card "Interactive Playground"
  .sp-playground data-controller="sp-playground" data-sp-playground-url-value="/docs/render"
    .sp-cluster style="align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem;"
      div style="flex: 1;"
        h4 Source (Slim/Ruby)
        textarea.sp-input data-sp-playground-target="input" data-action="input->sp-playground#render" rows="15" style="font-family: monospace; width: 100%; white-space: pre;"
          | / Try editing this!
            == ui_card "Playground Card"
              p This is rendered live.
              == ui_button "Click Me", :primary, onclick: "alert('It works!')"

      div style="flex: 1;"
        h4 Live Preview
        .sp-card data-sp-playground-target="output" style="min-height: 300px; border: 2px dashed var(--sp-color-border); padding: 1rem;"
